Wrote the coder-2.json label for Robert Rivas's rent-regulation row: AB 1482 (2019-2020), on which he voted Aye in the Assembly, coded chair-shaped for rung 2 ("Strengthen existing rent stabilization and extend coverage to more units") — it extends rent-cap and just-cause coverage statewide while its own findings clause disclaims preempting stronger local ordinances, ruling out both rung 1 (explicit exemptions mean it doesn't cover all units) and rung 3 (it's an expansion, not a maintenance of status quo).
